<itemSchema><field id="textDesc" type="input"><value>Low-top lace-up casual walking shoes with panelled uppers and round lace eyelets. Color options: Beige, Tan, Black. Confirmed EU size labels 36-48; confirm the size chart and fit before ordering. Send your color and size mix, pair quantity, packaging requirements and destination for a quotation. Material composition, availability, final price and dispatch timing are confirmed for each order. Sample availability and customization feasibility require review before confirmation.</value></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China and serves overseas B2B footwear buyers. Company images show general company-level development, production, checking and order coordination activities. Product-specific specifications, availability and services are confirmed after receiving your order requirements.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colors and sizes can I enquire about?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Color options include Beige, Tan, Black, with confirmed EU size labels 36-48. Confirm the size chart, fit and availability for your requested mix before ordering; US sizing is not inferred from the EU labels.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What information is needed for a quotation?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send the color and size mix, pair quantity, packaging requirements and destination. Listed prices are product references; freight, applicable taxes and additional order services are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which specifications should be confirmed before an order?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Confirm the requested style, material specifications, color and size mix, quantity, packaging and any sample requirements. Product-specific details and availability are checked before the order is confirmed.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I enquire about samples and custom branding?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send your color, size, logo artwork and packaging brief. Sample availability, customization feasibility, costs and timing are reviewed for this style before confirmation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>When will the order be dispatched?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Dispatch depends on availability, order quantity, size mix and packing requirements. Timing is confirmed for each order before proceeding.</value></field></complex-values></field><field id="productTitle" type="input"><value>Wholesale Unisex Casual Sneakers Low Top Lace Up Walking Shoes with Panelled Uppers for Everyday Wear</value></field><field id="productKeywords" type="complex"><complex-value><field id="productKeywords_0" type="input"><value>Wholesale unisex casual sneakers low top lace up walking shoes for everyday wear</value></field></complex-value></field><field id="saleProp" name="Sales Property" type="complex"><complex-value><field id="p-191288010" name="Color" type="multiCheck"><values><value img="https://sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H1ae8361047ab4f0c972f1823074cc962M.jpg" inputValue="Black">3327837</value><value img="https://sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H0982b384dcbb4236af3026ced9cc35c82.jpg" inputValue="Beige">5715155</value><value img="https://sc04.alicdn.com/kf/H4fc7905473f54c4fb85505f0c4ef4021C.jpg" inputValue="Tan">-201</value></values></field><field id="p-222038415" type="multiCheck"><values><value inputValue="EU 36">-10036</value><value inputValue="EU 37">-10037</value><value inputValue="EU 38">-10038</value><value inputValue="EU 39">-10039</value><value inputValu